@startuml overview-oauth
!include theme.iuml
title Trilium ETAPI MCP — OAuth (remote access, app clients)

skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber

actor "MCP client\n(claude.ai, desktop, IDE)" as Client
participant "trilium-mcp\n(this repo)" as Sidecar #98D486
participant "Trilium\nETAPI" as Trilium

== Once per client ==
Client -> Sidecar : browser login\nwith the Trilium password
Sidecar -> Trilium : /auth/login
Trilium --> Sidecar : ETAPI token minted\nfor this client
Sidecar --> Client : OAuth access + refresh token

== Every tool call ==
Client -> Sidecar : MCP tool call over HTTP\nAuthorization: Bearer <access token>
Sidecar -> Trilium : mapped ETAPI token forwarded to /etapi
Trilium --> Sidecar : notes data
Sidecar --> Client : MCP tool result

note over Sidecar : Stores the minted ETAPI tokens\nencrypted; the client only ever\nholds opaque OAuth tokens.

@enduml
